    "dgf_testimonial_f9eLmm": {
      "type": "dgf-testimonial",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_BrXRPm": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>I’ve been taking this product for years it’s good for so many different health issues.</p>",
            "author_name": "-Connie Basore"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_MpVh4z": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>Tribe Organics doesn't cut corners on their supplements, and their organic moringa is no exception. I noticed a gradual positive improvement after several weeks of taking this supplement. Sharper thinking, better sleep, more energy, were all detectable, so I am extremely pleased with this addition to my diet, and will definitely continue to take. Top rating for Tribe Organics Moringa,and well deserved.</p>",
            "author_name": "-Ted"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_A9AeQw": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>Great quality and value. Gives me a little morning boost. Responsive CS. Fabulous company!!</p>",
            "author_name": "-Susan Andrews"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_JUk3jw": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>Having researched Moringa, I know that the content of the capsules need to be a bright green to have any potency and these capsules contain the green powder, as they should. I decided to take these capsules because (even before Covid-19!), I wanted to try to improve my immune system. Having taken these capsules now for some time, I feel really well and strong and I have had no illnesses over the winter. So, these capsules are definitely a better way for me to get all the nutrients into me. I intend to keep ordering to make sure I stay as healthy as possible.<br/><br/></p>",
            "author_name": "-WF"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_88qjkH": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>Having this in pill form is great! It is an easy way to get more nutrients with my daily routine and it has helped my overall health. I have noticed a significant difference in my overall health using this product.</p>",
            "author_name": "-Rose"
          }
        }
      },
