      "name": "[DGF] Image and Icons",
      "settings": {
        "section_title": "<h2>Meet Moringa: The Miracle Tree</h2>",
        "section_subtitle": "<p>Revered for thousands of years in Ayurveda as the “Tree of Life” or “Miracle Tree”, Moringa has been used as a daily tonic to restore energy, vitality and balance.</p>\n<li>In India, Ayurvedic healers prescribed Moringa leaves to boost immunity, improve digestion and nourish the body with essential nutrients.</li>\n<li>In Africa and Asia, it has long been relied on as a vital source of nutrition during times of scarcity, thanks to its rich concentration of vitamins, minerals and amino acids.</li>\n<li>Modern herbalists praise it as one of nature’s most nutrient-dense superfoods, with unparalleled benefits for energy, immunity and overall wellness.</li>\n<p>Across cultures and across time, Moringa has endured as both a powerful superfood and a trusted healing plant. Today, science confirms its ability to deliver sustained energy, immune defense, skin and hair support, and detoxification, making it one of the most complete plant allies for modern life.</p>",
        "left_image": "shopify://shop_images/217272635_1329584270789578_5280560696201114570_n_1_189b1b66-fdd7-4cc4-8448-46b199ae5e34.webp",
        "column_title": "Powerful Benefits of <span style=\"font-family: 'HypatiaSansPro';\">MORINGA</span>",
        "mobile_column_title_primary": "Powerful Benefits of <span style=\"font-family: 'HypatiaSansPro';\">MORINGA</span>",
        "mobile_column_title_secondary": "",
        "bg_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
        "text_color": "#ffffff",
        "padding_top": 20,
        "padding_bottom": 0
